Package: eqR
Type: Package
Title: Test Form Equating
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Isaac Pfleger, Robert L. Brennan, Tianyou Wang, Seonghoon Kim, and Jaehoon Seol
Maintainer: Isaac Pfleger <isaac@cms.itemexperts.com>
Description: This project is an R package that provides a modern, user-friendly implementation of the "Equating Recipes" program, originally written in C by Robert L. Brennan, Tianyou Wang, Seonghoon Kim, and Jaehoon Seol. "Equating Recipes" is a comprehensive set of functions for performing various psychometric equating methods, as described in the book "Test Equating, Scaling, and Linking: Methods and Practices" by Kolen and Brennan (2014).
